usage: prepare_data.py [-h] --raw-root RAW_ROOT --output OUTPUT
                       [--spacing SPACING] [--workers WORKERS] [--seed SEED]
                       [--case-ids CASE_IDS [CASE_IDS ...]] [--force]

Prepare the public ASOCA training set without changing the input field of
view. Only binary segmentation labels are available. The auxiliary topology
categories below are geometric training targets, not named coronary artery
classes.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --raw-root RAW_ROOT
  --output OUTPUT
  --spacing SPACING
  --workers WORKERS
  --seed SEED
  --case-ids CASE_IDS [CASE_IDS ...]
                        Smoke-test subset; manifest still freezes all 40 folds
  --force
